DY OARN YEAH DA YEE YIARN SAGGYRT AIN

208
00:12:03,179 --> 00:12:09,060
REN AD LEEIDEIL GASS LAAYL UNNANE TA CLASHTYN

209
00:12:09,059 --> 00:12:14,340
MY AASH DA LAKSAA GYNGROAM BANCEYRAGHT AS GLARE

210
00:12:14,549 --> 00:12:16,860
UNGAAR NAILT EGGAGHYN

211
00:12:18,899 --> 00:12:25,169
BEE EH IMRAA JEANT JEH CRAGH NADAL ETLANN

212
00:12:25,169 --> 00:12:29,969
NAVAL FO AS BIOAL SY TEIHLL TRA VA

213
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:34,170
AS NY CAIR VIE NOA AYNS IMNEA YN

214
00:12:34,169 --> 00:12:40,470
SKEEAL LIEHVOAYL SESSAY SHEN REIR BRIAN MAC STOYL

215
00:12:40,470 --> 00:12:42,899
AS MRAANE VA JEANT MYCHIONE Y LILY VOISH

216
00:12:42,899 --> 00:12:45,299
DRIGIT AYNS POLT YN HOGHTOO LAA AS FEED

217
00:12:45,299 --> 00:12:48,120
MEE NY NOLLICK HOGHT CHEEAD JEIG DAAYEIG AS

218
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:52,259
DAEED VA DAA VENTREOGHE AS FEED FAAGIT AS

219
00:12:52,259 --> 00:12:55,560
TREE FEED AS SHIAGHT PAITCHEY FAAGIT GYNAYR SHICKYRAGHEY

220
00:12:55,559 --> 00:12:58,470
SHEN COMMEEYS Y CAPTAN AS E VAC DYS

221
00:12:58,470 --> 00:13:01,710
THREE DEINEY VEH BWOAILT TRA VA LIBBY BUITCHOOR

222
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:02,370
Y TOSHIAGHT

223
00:13:03,929 --> 00:13:06,360
AGH NYYEIH SHEN SHE NOLLICK AS YN VLEIN

224
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,789
NOA T'AYN NEESHT AS T'EH KIART DY LIOOAR

225
00:13:08,789 --> 00:13:11,370
UN GEAISHTAGH RISH SHENN CHARREY MIE ELLEY DYN

226
00:13:11,370 --> 00:13:14,699
GHAELG JUAN Y GEILL AD LOAYRT DY BANNAG

227
00:13:14,700 --> 00:13:16,710
VA NY GUILLYN GRA TRA VA GOLL MYGEAYRT

228
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:20,099
NY THIE-YN SYN IMBAGH SHOH GYN OURYS AYNS

229
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:22,770
NY SHENN LAGHYN AYNS TREISHT DY CHOSNEY PAART

230
00:13:22,769 --> 00:13:25,529
DY VEE DY DTY YOGA AS SON NEEYM

231
00:13:25,529 --> 00:13:27,750
CUR JERREY ER Y PHODCHREELEY SHOH ABBYR SHEN

232
00:13:27,779 --> 00:13:30,959
REESHT LESH Y VANNAG SHOH AS SHOH SLIENNOO

233
00:13:32,039 --> 00:13:36,389
NOLLICK GHENNAL ERRIU AS BLEIN FEER VIE SEIHLL

234
00:13:36,539 --> 00:13:38,850
AS SLAYNT DAN SLANE LUGHTTHIE

235
00:13:39,990 --> 00:13:44,340
BEA AS GENNALLYS EU BIO RYCHEILLEY SHEE AS

236
00:13:44,370 --> 00:13:48,840
GRAIH EDDYR MRAANE AS DEINEY COOID AS COURYN

237
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:53,639
STOCK AS STOYR PALCHEY PUDDASE AS SCADDAN DY

238
00:13:53,669 --> 00:13:58,110
LIOOAR ARRAN AS CAASHEY EEYM AS ROAYRT

239
00:13:59,279 --> 00:14:02,520
BAASE MIE LUGH AYNS YLLIN AS SOALT

240
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:08,549
CADLEY SAUCHEY TRA HIG SHIU DY LHIE AS

241
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:11,729
FEEACKLYN YN JARGAN NAGH BEE DY MIE

242
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:13,710
HE

243
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:23,610
IS KILLING AS BLEIN VIE NOA OOILLEY AS

244
00:14:25,259 --> 00:14:28,439
AYNS UN LAA VEAGH YN AS YNSEE ELLEY

245
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,479
LHIAMLHIAT CHENGEY TUITTEE AD LHIATTEE

246
00:14:32,700 --> 00:14:36,360
RY HOI LHIETTAL HOSANNA HIE FEED ATCHIN HASS

247
00:14:36,389 --> 00:14:40,590
LHIASSVOIR LHIASSVOIR SHOH IS IT ASSDOO AS IS

248
00:14:40,590 --> 00:14:42,960
LAA JEH'N PHOSSAN SHOH

249
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:47,699
EARISHYN Y THIE

